    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Afilisti apigana na Aiziraeli, nao atu a Iziraeli achichimbira Afilisti, na anji aho achiolagbwa mwango wa Giliboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afilisti angʼakira Sauli na anae, phapha na phapha, na achiolaga Jonathani, Abinadabu na Maliki-Shua, ana a Sauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Viha vyakala vikali kpwa Sauli, hata anajeshi akuhumira maha achimgbwira na achimlumiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Sauli achimuambira mtsukuziwe wa silaha, “Tuluza upangao unidunge nao, sedze hinya atu asiodekpwa akanidunga na kunigayisa.” Ela ye mtsukuziwe wa silaha warema, kpwa sababu waogopha sana. Phahi Sauli achihala upangawe, achiugbwerera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuona Sauli akafwa, ye mtsukuziwe wa silaha naye wagbwerera upangawe na achifwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivyo ndivyo ambavyo Sauli wafwa phamwenga na anae ahahu, mtsukuziwe wa silaha na atue osi, afwa chivyamwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu osi a Iziraeli ariokala anasagala ko deteni, ariphosikira kukala jeshi rikachimbira na Sauli na anae akafwa, midzi yao airicha nao achichimbira. Afilisti akpwedza achiihala yo midzi, achisagala mumo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya phiriye, Afilisti ariphokpwendahala zewe za atu arioolagbwa, amuona Sauli na anae akafwa dzulu ya mwango wa Giliboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho amvula mavwazige, achihala chitswache na silahaze, chisha achihuma ahumwa tsi yosi ya Afilisti ili akatangaze habari kpwa vizuka vyao na kpwa atu ao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zo silahaze akpwendaziika nyumba ya kuvoya milungu yao na chitswache achichitsomeka nyumba ya kuvoya mlungu wao, Dagoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
